        "title": "Remove hard-blocked message formatter utility",
        "summary": "The `formatFreebuffHardBlockedMessage` export is deleted from `common/src/util/freebuff-privacy.ts`. This function previously constructed a user-facing refusal string by prefixing the result of `formatFreebuffHardBlockedPrivacySignals` with 'Freebuff cannot be used from'. The remaining `formatFreebuffHardBlockedPrivacySignals` helper still exists to format signal labels, but the high-level message formatter is removed, likely as cleanup since the fixed Tor refusal constant `FREEBUFF_TOR_BLOCKED_MESSAGE` now handles the primary user-facing case.",
